    m_Localized: Bring water to the village
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899742
    m_Localized: Repair the post boat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899743
    m_Localized: Wake the orchard lights
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899744
    m_Localized: Open the road to the beacon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899745
    m_Localized: The storm took our lights. I will carry a new one to the Great Beacon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899746
    m_Localized: This bridge is high... One small step, Mika. Let's fix its pattern.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899747
    m_Localized: One light is back! Now I can see the wind gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899748
    m_Localized: These boards move when we land. I'll look before I leap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899749
    m_Localized: My scarf got caught. A little patch will hold it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899750
    m_Localized: The sky lift needs a patch too. Then we can reach the mill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899751
    m_Localized: I'm Pip. My mill stopped, and the village needs water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899752
    m_Localized: Will you help me mend it? We can work it out together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899753
    m_Localized: The wheel is turning! I can hear the water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899754
    m_Localized: Some boards are cracked. Use the strong ones when you can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899755
    m_Localized: The post boat can sail again. I kept a letter for your gran.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899756
    m_Localized: Take it with you. She'll be glad to know we're all right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899757
    m_Localized: I'm Rue. I grow lantern fruit. They glow when the night comes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899758
    m_Localized: Help me light the trees. Try to find a stamp along the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899759
    m_Localized: Look, Mika. The beacon is beyond those clouds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472899760
    m_Localized: You've helped us find each other. We'll help you reach it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4696902197248
    m_Localized: left behind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12135563255808
    m_Localized: Your saved path
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12135567450112
    m_Localized: We found a backup. Your last move may be missing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12135567450113
    m_Localized: We can't open this puzzle. Your lights are safe. Start a new one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12135567450114
    m_Localized: This path needs a newer game. Update CASCADE to open it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12135567450115
    m_Localized: We could not read your saved path. You can start a new one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12135567450116
    m_Localized: Start a new puzzle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12135567450117
    m_Localized: Could not save. Keep the game open and try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12135567450118
    m_Localized: Try saving again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14410444693504
    m_Localized: Start a new path
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
